## Quick start

{% if language == "python" -%}
Install the project dependencies:
```bash
uv sync --all-extras
```
Run the project's documented Python entry point with `uv run`.
{% elif language == "go" -%}
Run the Go project locally:
```bash
go run .
```
{% elif language == "rust" -%}
Run the Rust project locally:
```bash
cargo run
```
{% endif %}
{% if docker -%}
Authenticate when the package is private, then pull the image:
```bash
docker login ghcr.io
docker pull ghcr.io/{{ repository_name | lower }}:latest
```
{% endif %}
